## ObjectType: Product

Product sold through CRM orders.

### Data Properties

| Name | Display Name | Type | Description | Mapped Field |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| product_id | Product ID | string | Unique product code | product_id |
| name | Product Name | string | Commercial name | name |
| category | Category | string | Product family | category |
| list_price | List Price | decimal | Catalog price | list_price |

